    your opponent: You can Special Summon this card from your hand.\r\n\u25CF During
    your Main or Battle Phase: You can return this card to the hand, and if you do,
    Special Summon 5 monsters (1 \"Kuribah\", 1 \"Kuribee\", 1 \"Kuriboo\", 1 \"Kuribeh\",
    and 1 \"Kuriboh\") from your hand and/or GY in Attack Position."
